sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform User
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as MCPServerReconciler<br/>controller-runtime v0.24.1
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap/Secret Store
    participant Deployment as Managed Deployment
    participant Service as Managed Service
    participant NetPolicy as Managed NetworkPolicy
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus

    Note over User,NetPolicy: MCPServer Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply MCPServer CR<br/>mcp.x-k8s.io/v1alpha1
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event (For: MCPServer)

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET MCPServer<br/>ServiceAccount Token Auth
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: MCPServer spec<br/>(image, port, args, env, mounts)

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET referenced ConfigMaps
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: ConfigMap data
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET referenced Secrets
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Secret data

    Note over Reconciler: Compute config hash<br/>for rolling updates

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Deployment<br/>(ownerRef → MCPServer)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Deployment created/updated

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Service<br/>(ownerRef → MCPServer)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Service created/updated

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE NetworkPolicy<br/>(ownerRef → MCPServer)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: NetworkPolicy created/updated

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: PATCH MCPServer/status<br/>(Ready, Accepted conditions)

    Note over User,NetPolicy: Config Change Re-reconciliation

    ConfigMap-->>Reconciler: Watch event (ConfigMap changed)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET MCPServer (re-reconcile)
    Note over Reconciler: Recompute config hash<br/>triggers rolling update
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: UPDATE Deployment<br/>(new config hash annotation)

    Note over User,NetPolicy: Metrics Scraping

    Prometheus->>Reconciler: GET :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS + TokenReview/SAR
    Reconciler-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics

    Note over User,NetPolicy: Health Probes

    K8sAPI->>Reconciler: GET :8081/healthz<br/>HTTP, unauthenticated
    Reconciler-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
    K8sAPI->>Reconciler: GET :8081/readyz<br/>HTTP, unauthenticated
    Reconciler-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
